        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Scunthorpe Telegraph, Grimsby Telegraph\n- Places: Scunthorpe, England, Grimsby, North East Lincolnshire, Market Rasen, Louth\n- Topics: local newspapers, regional newspaper coverage, publication history\n\nFacts:\n- The Scunthorpe Telegraph was launched on 8 September 1937.\n- Before the Scunthorpe Telegraph launched, Scunthorpe was served by the Grimsby Evening Telegraph.\n- The Scunthorpe Telegraph is a local paid-for newspaper that is published and distributed weekly in Scunthorpe, England.\n- The Grimsby Telegraph is a daily British regional newspaper for Grimsby and the surrounding area of North East Lincolnshire, including Market Rasen and Louth.",
